        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "001006",
        "transcript": "She took it over and worked on it all night to meet the deadline.",
        "target_signal": "把并列动作切块并恢复块内多处连读",
        "pronunciation_notes": "Evaluate the audible pronunciation phenomenon named by this target: 把并列动作切块并恢复块内多处连读",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "001007",
        "transcript": "In fast speech, best option often sounds like bes toption, where the final t links forward and the boundary becomes less obvious.",
        "target_signal": "从发音讲解中识别 best option 的 /t/ 前向衔接",
        "pronunciation_notes": "Evaluate the audible pronunciation phenomenon named by this target: 从发音讲解中识别 best option 的 /t/ 前向衔接",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "001008",
        "transcript": "The phrase pick it up is pronounced quickly as pi ki tup, showing how consonant to vowel linking keeps the rhythm moving.",
        "target_signal": "恢复 pick it up 的两个连续边界",
        "pronunciation_notes": "Evaluate the audible pronunciation phenomenon named by this target: 恢复 pick it up 的两个连续边界",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
